      "stable_member": false,
      "summary": "Every positive pairwise gcd-compatible successor list whose last modulus dominates all predecessors has its exact list LCM and a unique strictly bounded simultaneous solution without assuming pairwise coprimality or the stronger merge invariant."
    },
